<section
  class="wwb-section wwb-future"
  id="the-future"
  aria-labelledby="wwb-future-title"
>
  <div class="wwb-shell wwb-future-layout">
    <div class="wwb-future-copy">
      <p class="wwb-eyebrow">THE FUTURE</p>
      <h2 id="wwb-future-title">
        The problems will change. The way we solve them <em>won’t.</em>
      </h2>
      <p>
        We will keep looking for problems where better intelligence can create meaningful
        change—learning today, and whatever important problem comes next.
      </p>
      <div class="wwb-future-cta">
        <span>Have a problem worth solving?</span>
        <a class="wwb-text-link" href="/company/careers-contact/">
          Talk to E Deviser <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
